<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal's BES raises BIC stake to 99 pct.</title>
<headline>Portugal's BES raises BIC stake to 99 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco Espirito Santo bought 52.3 percent of Banco Internacional de Credito (BIC) at the public offer to buy (OPA) that ended on Wednesday, raising its total stake to 99.6 percent, the Lisbon bourse said.</p>
<p>BES bought 6.1 million shares at 2,790 escudos per share.</p>
<p>--Lisbon bureau 3511-3150035</p>
</text>
